## Session Context (windows-computer-use-mcp)

Before starting work: recall this server exposes 18 portmanteau tools
(automation_windows/elements/mouse/keyboard/visual/dialog/shortcut/task/mission/smart/macro/watch,
automation_system, get_desktop_state, get_window_state, approve_automation, automation_safety).
Mutating actions need approve_automation first (or BYPASS_HITL=1 for trusted runs).
At end of work: verify with `uv run --no-sync ruff check src/` + pytest, commit per AGENTS.md.
